  "bio": "Bald Babes Ink is renowned in Port of Spain, Trinidad and Tobago, for their extraordinary minimalist tattoo artistry. The dynamic duo of 👽 @gesiye and 👽 @artbymayaxl upholds the highest standards of professionalism, ensuring that every client's experience is as impeccable as their stunning ink work. These badass Black Women Artists bring a level of excellence and dedication to their craft that truly sets them apart in the tattooing community. 🏳️‍🌈✨\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Port Of Spain, Trinidad, Trinidad And Tobago"
